  "instance_name": "landmine_concept",
  "label": "Landmine",
  "description": "Landmines are explosive devices designed to be triggered by the weight or pressure of a person stepping on them. Their activation mechanism relies on mechanical pressure, making them ineffective against very light individuals. This real-world knowledge is essential to understand the absurdity of the meme's premise — that someone is so light they cannot trigger a landmine.",
